{"id": "unknown-2026-06-02-010", "date": "2026-06-02", "time_tags": {"year": 2026, "quarter": "Q2", "month": 6, "week": 23, "weekday": "Tue"}, "entities": {"companies": [], "customers": [], "suppliers": []}, "topics": ["industry_general"], "sentiment": {"label": "neutral", "score": 0.0, "keywords": []}, "importance": {"score": 0.5, "reasons": []}, "title": "Planned solar gigafactory in France welcomes new investor", "content": "<p>Ecolab has announced a €100 million ($116.5 million) investment across two French infrastructure projects, including the planned HoloSolis gigafactory for solar cells and modules. </p>\n<p>The post <a href=\"https://www.pv-magazine.com/2026/06/02/la-future-gigafactory-photovoltaique-holosolis-accueille-un-nouvel-investisseur/\">Planned solar gigafactory in France welcomes new investor</a> appeared first on <a href=\"https://www.pv-magazine.com\">pv magazine Global</a>.</p>\n", "sources": [{"name": "pv_magazine", "url": "https://www.pv-magazine.com/2026/06/02/la-future-gigafactory-photovoltaique-holosolis-accueille-un-nouvel-investisseur/", "type": "rss"}]}
{"id": "unknown-2026-06-02-011", "date": "2026-06-02", "time_tags": {"year": 2026, "quarter": "Q2", "month": 6, "week": 23, "weekday": "Tue"}, "entities": {"companies": [], "customers": [], "suppliers": []}, "topics": ["industry_general"], "sentiment": {"label": "neutral", "score": 0.0, "keywords": []}, "importance": {"score": 0.5, "reasons": []}, "title": "Argentine football club inaugurates 120 kW solar system", "content": "<p>Buenos Aires-based Club Atlético Vélez Sarsfield has switched on a 120 kW rooftop solar system on top of its football stadium, expected to cover up to 20% of its annual electricity demand. </p>\n<p>The post <a href=\"https://www.pv-magazine.com/2026/06/02/el-club-argentino-velez-sarsfield-inaugura-una-planta-solar-de-120-kwp-en-su-estadio-de-futbol-y-preve-cubrir-hasta-el-20-de-su-demanda-electrica/\">Argentine football club inaugurates 120 kW solar system</a> appeared first on <a href=\"https://", "sources": [{"name": "pv_magazine", "url": "https://www.pv-magazine.com/2026/06/02/el-club-argentino-velez-sarsfield-inaugura-una-planta-solar-de-120-kwp-en-su-estadio-de-futbol-y-preve-cubrir-hasta-el-20-de-su-demanda-electrica/", "type": "rss"}]}
{"id": "unknown-2026-06-02-012", "date": "2026-06-02", "time_tags": {"year": 2026, "quarter": "Q2", "month": 6, "week": 23, "weekday": "Tue"}, "entities": {"companies": [], "customers": [], "suppliers": []}, "topics": ["industry_general"], "sentiment": {"label": "neutral", "score": 0.0, "keywords": []}, "importance": {"score": 0.5, "reasons": []}, "title": "Nextpower files patent lawsuit against Gamechange", "content": "<p>In a lawsuit filed in the US District Court of Delaware, Nextpower alleges that Gamechange Energy has infringed on three of its patents related to tracker technology and software. Gamechange has denied the infringements and says it plans to mount a full defense. </p>\n<p>The post <a href=\"https://www.pv-magazine.com/2026/06/02/nextpower-files-patent-lawsuit-against-gamechange/\">Nextpower files patent lawsuit against Gamechange</a> appeared first on <a href=\"https://www.pv-magazine.com\">pv maga", "sources": [{"name": "pv_magazine", "url": "https://www.pv-magazine.com/2026/06/02/nextpower-files-patent-lawsuit-against-gamechange/", "type": "rss"}]}
{"id": "unknown-2026-06-02-013", "date": "2026-06-02", "time_tags": {"year": 2026, "quarter": "Q2", "month": 6, "week": 23, "weekday": "Tue"}, "entities": {"companies": [], "customers": [], "suppliers": []}, "topics": ["industry_general"], "sentiment": {"label": "neutral", "score": 0.0, "keywords": []}, "importance": {"score": 0.5, "reasons": []}, "title": "Philippines proposes stricter PV, battery product certification rules", "content": "<p>The proposed regulation for product safety and quality standards applies to all solar and PV components, whether locally manufactured or imported. </p>\n<p>The post <a href=\"https://www.pv-magazine.com/2026/06/02/philippines-proposes-stricter-solar-and-battery-product-certification-rules/\">Philippines proposes stricter PV, battery product certification rules</a> appeared first on <a href=\"https://www.pv-magazine.com\">pv magazine Global</a>.</p>\n", "sources": [{"name": "pv_magazine", "url": "https://www.pv-magazine.com/2026/06/02/philippines-proposes-stricter-solar-and-battery-product-certification-rules/", "type": "rss"}]}
{"id": "unknown-2026-06-02-014", "date": "2026-06-02", "time_tags": {"year": 2026, "quarter": "Q2", "month": 6, "week": 23, "weekday": "Tue"}, "entities": {"companies": [], "customers": [], "suppliers": []}, "topics": ["industry_general"], "sentiment": {"label": "neutral", "score": 0.0, "keywords": []}, "importance": {"score": 0.5, "reasons": []}, "title": "Slovenia to introduce electricity sharing", "content": "<p>Slovenia will launch electricity sharing on July 1, allowing solar owners to transfer excess electricity to designated recipients anywhere in the country at a mutually agreed price. Registration for the scheme is now open.</p>\n<p>The post <a href=\"https://www.pv-magazine.com/2026/06/02/slovenia-to-introduce-electricity-sharing/\">Slovenia to introduce electricity sharing</a> appeared first on <a href=\"https://www.pv-magazine.com\">pv magazine Global</a>.</p>\n", "sources": [{"name": "pv_magazine", "url": "https://www.pv-magazine.com/2026/06/02/slovenia-to-introduce-electricity-sharing/", "type": "rss"}]}
{"id": "tongwei-2026-06-02-015", "date": "2026-06-02", "time_tags": {"year": 2026, "quarter": "Q2", "month": 6, "week": 23, "weekday": "Tue"}, "entities": {"companies": ["tongwei"], "customers": [], "suppliers": []}, "topics": ["industry_general"], "sentiment": {"label": "neutral", "score": 0.0, "keywords": []}, "importance": {"score": 0.5, "reasons": []}, "title": "Tongwei to showcase TNC 3.0 series at Intersolar Europe 2026", "content": "<p>Tongwei will bring its next-generation flagship solar model – the TNC 3.0 series – to Intersolar Europe 2026 along with a lineup of additional new products and solutions.</p>\n<p>The post <a href=\"https://www.pv-magazine.com/2026/06/02/tongwei-to-showcase-tnc-3-0-series-at-intersolar-europe-2026/\">Tongwei to showcase TNC 3.0 series at Intersolar Europe 2026</a> appeared first on <a href=\"https://www.pv-magazine.com\">pv magazine Global</a>.</p>\n", "sources": [{"name": "pv_magazine", "url": "https://www.pv-magazine.com/2026/06/02/tongwei-to-showcase-tnc-3-0-series-at-intersolar-europe-2026/", "type": "rss"}]}
{"id": "unknown-2026-06-02-016", "date": "2026-06-02", "time_tags": {"year": 2026, "quarter": "Q2", "month": 6, "week": 23, "weekday": "Tue"}, "entities": {"companies": [], "customers": [], "suppliers": []}, "topics": ["industry_general"], "sentiment": {"label": "neutral", "score": 0.0, "keywords": []}, "importance": {"score": 0.5, "reasons": []}, "title": "German startup advancing compressor-free electrocaloric heat pump technology", "content": "<p>Qurie GmbH has developed a heat pump that replaces traditional vapor-compression cycles with solid-state materials, potentially reaching over 70% theoretical efficiency and cutting energy use by up to 30%. Its patented heat-pipe-based design enables fast evaporation-condensation heat transfer without complex mechanics, achieving up to 20 Hz operation and aiming for compact, efficient cooling in sub-10 kW applications.</p>\n<p>The post <a href=\"https://www.pv-magazine.com/2026/06/02/german-star", "sources": [{"name": "pv_magazine", "url": "https://www.pv-magazine.com/2026/06/02/german-startup-advancing-compressor-free-electrocaloric-heat-pump-technology/", "type": "rss"}]}
